{
  "FormatVersion": 1,
  "Name": "ErrorPass",
  "Source": "forward_pipeline/error_pass.hlsl",
  "_Comment": "由 radray_shader_gen 从真实反射生成后手工收敛。KeywordGroups 由 #pragma radray_keyword_group 派生, 勿手改。",
  "_KeywordComment": "这两组并非 error_pass 自己声明, 而是从 <forward_pipeline/view.hlsli> 继承 —— 入口 shader 继承所有 include 的 keyword 组。error_pass 不采样阴影, 开启它们对本 pass 无意义, 但组集合是 shader 源的属性而非使用方的选择, 故须如实声明。",
  "KeywordGroups": [
    {
      "Name": "PointShadows",
      "Keywords": [
        "_POINT_SHADOWS"
      ],
      "IsOptional": true,
      "Stages": [
        "Pixel"
      ]
    },
    {
      "Name": "DirectionalShadows",
      "Keywords": [
        "_DIRECTIONAL_SHADOWS"
      ],
      "IsOptional": true,
      "Stages": [
        "Pixel"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "_BakeComment": "不声明任何规则 = 只烘默认变体 (两组阴影 keyword 全关)。兜底 pass 不采样阴影, 也没有其他可选特性, 无需预编其他组合。",
  "Passes": [
    {
      "Name": "Error",
      "Stages": [
        {
          "Stage": "Vertex",
          "EntryPoint": "VSMain"
        },
        {
          "Stage": "Pixel",
          "EntryPoint": "PSMain"
        }
      ],
      "ShaderModel": "SM62",
      "IsOptimize": true,
      "EnableUnbounded": true,
      "_BindingComment": "view.hlsli 在 _POINT_SHADOWS / _DIRECTIONAL_SHADOWS 下还声明了 t1/t2/s3 三个阴影绑定, 但 error_pass 的 PSMain 返回常量、从不采样它们, 故任何变体的反射里都不会出现 —— 声明它们会让 manifest 描述一份不存在的 ABI。",
      "BindingGroups": [
        {
          "Group": 0,
          "Bindings": [
            {
              "Name": "gPerObject",
              "Binding": 1,
              "Type": "CBuffer",
              "Stages": [
                "Vertex"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "Group": 1,
          "_ViewStageComment": "只有 Vertex —— PSMain 不读 gView。",
          "Bindings": [
            {
              "Name": "gView",
              "Binding": 0,
              "Type": "CBuffer",
              "Stages": [
                "Vertex"
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "VertexInput": {
        "Buffers": [
          {
            "Binding": 0,
            "ArrayStride": 12,
            "StepMode": "Vertex"
          }
        ],
        "Attributes": [
          {
            "Semantic": "POSITION",
            "SemanticIndex": 0,
            "Format": "FLOAT32X3",
            "BufferBinding": 0,
            "Offset": 0
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
